  "- `password authentication failed`: the database rejected the login. Check `DATABASE_USERNAME` and `DATABASE_PASSWORD` — the collector expands `$` inside them once more, so every `$` must be written as `$$` in `.env` or a Kubernetes Secret (the install script does this).":
    "- `password authentication failed`: databasen afviste loginnet. Tjek `DATABASE_USERNAME` og `DATABASE_PASSWORD` — collectoren udfolder `$` i dem én gang til, så hvert `$` skal skrives som `$$` i `.env` eller en Kubernetes-Secret (installationsscriptet gør det).",
  "- `permission denied`, `must be superuser`, or connection counts that always read `1`: the monitoring user is missing the grants from step 2.":
    "- `permission denied`, `must be superuser` eller antal forbindelser, der altid viser `1`: overvågningsbrugeren mangler rettighederne fra trin 2.",
  "- `pg_stat_statements` errors: top queries are on without the extension — create it (see Query samples and top queries), or set `DATABASE_QUERY_EVENTS=false`.":
    "- Fejl fra `pg_stat_statements`: topforespørgsler er slået til uden udvidelsen — opret den (se Forespørgselseksempler og topforespørgsler), eller sæt `DATABASE_QUERY_EVENTS=false`.",
  "- `failed to explain` is not a missing grant: explain plans of top queries need `SELECT` on your tables, which `pg_monitor` deliberately does not give. Metrics and top queries are unaffected; only the plans stay empty.":
    "- `failed to explain` er ikke en manglende rettighed: udførelsesplaner for topforespørgsler kræver `SELECT` på dine tabeller, som `pg_monitor` bevidst ikke giver. Metrikker og topforespørgsler påvirkes ikke; kun planerne forbliver tomme.",
  "- TLS errors (`SSL is not enabled on the server`): match `DATABASE_TLS_INSECURE` to the server — `true` when it does not speak TLS, `false` when it requires it, plus `DATABASE_TLS_INSECURE_SKIP_VERIFY=true` for a certificate the collector image does not trust.":
    "- TLS-fejl (`SSL is not enabled on the server`): tilpas `DATABASE_TLS_INSECURE` til serveren — `true`, når den ikke taler TLS, `false`, når den kræver det, plus `DATABASE_TLS_INSECURE_SKIP_VERIFY=true` for et certifikat, som collector-imaget ikke har tillid til.",
